# Defend the Celestus: "Distribute three +1/+1 counters among one, two, or
# three target creatures" (DividedAsYouChoose$ 3). CR 601.2d: two targets
# for three counters is a real division, announced right after the targets
# as the spell is cast (PlayerControllerHuman.java:2486-2527); each target
# gets its own share at resolution (CountersPutEffect.java:460-461).
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 5 G
tapformana ai 6 G
tapformana ai 7 G
tapformana ai 8 G
queue targets 1,2
queue divide 2,1
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
